# Library of Leng and Darksteel Colossus under Wheel of Fortune, the Colossus first in Bot1's hand. Wheel's "each player
# discards their hand" is one simultaneous move: Bot1 puts the Lightning Bolt and the Island on top of the library with
# the Library, and lets the Colossus be revealed and shuffled into the library instead (CR 616.1). A library shuffled at
# the same time that cards are put in a certain position in it is randomized except those cards (CR 701.24g, whose
# example is Darksteel Colossus beside Gravebane Zombie): the Bolt and the Island stay on top, in the order Bot1 chooses
# for them (CR 401.4), whatever order the hand held them in, and the Colossus is shuffled into the rest. The shuffle is
# fixed to reverse what it shuffles ([Shuffles]): the rest - the Colossus, ten Forests, ten Swamps - comes out Swamps
# first and the Colossus last, so Wheel's seven draws are the Bolt, the Island and five Swamps.
[Shuffles]
Reverse

[Bot1 Deck]
Library of Leng
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Wheel of Fortune
Darksteel Colossus
Lightning Bolt
Island
Forest x10
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Library of Leng.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Wheel of Fortune.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Replace(Darksteel Colossus)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Arrange(Island; Lightning Bolt)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Shuffles = 1
Bot1.Hand = Island; Lightning Bolt; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
Bot1.Library = Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Darksteel Colossus
Bot1.Graveyard = Wheel of Fortune; Black Lotus
